        "original_id": "bcf58699-ad43-5f8e-810b-1a593a02cac9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Emerald Wand of Oz, Trouble Under Oz\n- People: William Stout, Eric Shanower, L. Frank Baum\n- Companies: HarperCollins, News Corp\n- Places: New York City\n- Concepts: Oz series\n\nFacts:\n- In 1900, L. Frank Baum started the Oz series.\n- In 2005, The Emerald Wand of Oz was published as a continuation of the Oz series.\n- The Emerald Wand of Oz was illustrated by William Stout.\n- The Emerald Wand of Oz was published by HarperCollins.\n- HarperCollins is headquartered in New York City.\n- HarperCollins is a subsidiary of News Corp.\n- Trouble Under Oz is a sequel to Eric Shanower's 2005 novel The Emerald Wand of Oz.\n- The Emerald Wand of Oz is a further continuation of the Oz series.",
